export anchor TypewriterStyle:
    number: 55
    screen: Inbox
    name: Typewriter
    idea: Every notification is a typed paper slip in an in-tray, and the open item is a memo with carbon-blue type, index-tab filters and finished work struck through.
    base: light
    palette:
        desk: #e7e1d3, the page behind the paper
        paper: #fffdf6, the memo, the tray and unread slips
        slip: #f7f1e1, read slips and inactive tabs
        onionskin: #eef2f7, the open slip and the sheet behind the memo
        ink: #1d1c1a, typed text, rules and the key buttons
        faded: #555046, slip headers, times and Re lines
        carbon: #24408e, the memo body, reply text, links and focus
        ribbonRed: #a1221b, unread marks, the unread slip edge and the count
        rule: #cfc6b2, paper and tab edges
        ruleBlue: #c4d0e6, the ruled lines of the reply field
    type:
        One typewriter stack, Courier New, Courier, Nimbus Mono PS,
        Liberation Mono, monospace. The brand is 28px bold uppercase with
        wide tracking. Memorandum is 22px bold uppercase with 0.35em
        tracking. The memo body is 17px in carbon blue on a 1.75 line
        height. Slip text is 15px on a 1.6 line height, and headers and
        times are 12px uppercase.
    layout:
        A masthead with the brand, the subtitle Inter-office memoranda, and
        Desk of Mara Okafor with the date at right, over a double rule.
        Below sit two columns, five to six. On the left, index tabs for
        All, Mentions, Assigned and Unread (3) hang over a paper in-tray
        titled In-tray with a key line, then six stacked slips each tilted
        a fraction of a degree. Each slip has a header line of status marks
        and the time, the typed sentence, and a Re line with the project.
        On the right the open item is a memo with a paper clip, a centred
        Memorandum heading, To, From, Date and Re lines, a dashed rule, the
        message, Encl. 3 prints as three slightly tilted photo prints with
        captions, a ruled reply field and three key buttons. Below 860px
        the memo stacks under the tray.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px between slips, 36 to 40px memo margins, 32px between columns.
    density: Medium. Each slip is three short typed lines.
    corners: Square everywhere. Slips and prints tilt a fraction of a degree.
    borders: 1px #cfc6b2 paper edges, a 4px ribbon red left edge on unread slips, 2px ink on key buttons, a double ink rule under headings and dashed rules inside the memo.
    shadows: Flat offset shadows with no blur, 3px 3px rgba(60,50,30,0.12) on paper and 2px 2px ink under the keys.
    icons:
        No drawn icons apart from the paper clip. Status is typed in
        brackets, with [*] unread in ribbon red, [/] done in ink with the
        task name struck through, [ ] read, and two arrows with on the desk
        for the open slip.
    focus: A 2px dashed carbon outline offset 3px. A focused reply field gets the same dashed outline around its ruled lines.
    tone: Office formal and terse, such as In-tray, Memorandum, Re, Encl. 3 prints and cc. Website redesign file.
